# ============================================================
#   DvE - icons of the Padania focus tree (LOM_focus.txt).
#   One sprite per focus, named after the focus. The .dds files
#   in gfx/interface/goals/LOM/ are copies of existing ITA/SOV/
#   CSR/UKR/RUS icons: replace a file to change its art.
#   legacy_lazy_load = no loads the texture at startup (as vanilla
#   does through goals_shine.gfx); without it the icons can show
#   as "?" on this Mac. Shine sprites: LOM_icone_focus_shine.gfx
# ============================================================

